pan class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451310/extras/d46eec8c460aedb4e00e2e347deb3564.poster.avif?t=1754048005\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451310/extras/d46eec8c460aedb4e00e2e347deb3564.webm?t=1754048005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451310/extras/d46eec8c460aedb4e00e2e347deb3564.mp4?t=1754048005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster Mop Up is inspired by other amazing games: PowerWash Simulator, House Flipper,\u00a0Viscera Cleanup Detail as well as other amazing simulator games Check them out too if you have not already!\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Rescue the scared little Ragamuffins from the human world and clean up all evidence of their existence. Mop stains, burn poop, and get rewarded with high tech gear and upgrades. Save enough, and you can even expand your home, decorate it, and live happily ever after with your fluffy little friends!",
